dramatic Mad Libs scene.

00:00:15.114 --> 00:00:16.382
-Sure.
-Okay, here we go.

00:00:16.382 --> 00:00:17.950
-Okay, this is great.
-Right?

00:00:17.950 --> 00:00:20.086
-Yeah.
-Give me an adjective.

00:00:20.086 --> 00:00:21.821
-Ah, flamboyant.

00:00:21.821 --> 00:00:23.623
[ Laughter ]

00:00:23.623 --> 00:00:24.857
-Flamboyant.
-Mm-hmm.

00:00:24.857 --> 00:00:27.893
Really making
our cue-card guys work.

00:00:27.893 --> 00:00:30.530
Pet name.
-Winston.

00:00:30.530 --> 00:00:32.699
-Wow, that was really fast.
Nickname for a kid.

00:00:32.699 --> 00:00:33.867
-Jimmy Bill Bob.

00:00:33.867 --> 00:00:36.469
[ Laughter ]

00:00:36.469 --> 00:00:38.271
-What?

00:00:38.271 --> 00:00:40.906
