-Late-night host.

00:00:43.877 --> 00:00:46.813
[ Laughter ]

00:00:46.813 --> 00:00:50.150
-What would you shout
if you stubbed your toe?

00:00:50.150 --> 00:00:51.484
-Falafel!

00:00:51.484 --> 00:00:56.823
[ Laughter ]

00:00:56.823 --> 00:00:58.291
-Give me a number.

00:00:58.291 --> 00:01:01.494
-6-8-0-1.

00:01:01.494 --> 00:01:03.362
