00:01:21.881 --> 00:01:23.783
-What? No.
-I have to do it?

00:01:23.783 --> 00:01:25.385
-This is a game.
It's fun.

00:01:25.385 --> 00:01:26.952
Say any food.
-Ballpark hot dog.

00:01:26.952 --> 00:01:30.889
-Ballpark hot dog.
[ Laughter ]

00:01:30.889 --> 00:01:33.759
