knows what a Rob Roy is!

00:01:41.601 --> 00:01:43.803
-They do now.
Rob Roys for everyone!

00:01:43.803 --> 00:01:45.671
-Rob Roys for everyone here.

00:01:45.671 --> 00:01:47.406
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:47.406 --> 00:01:49.875
Rob Roy is great.

00:01:49.875 --> 00:01:51.711
A verb ending in "-ing."

00:01:51.711 --> 00:01:55.314
-Uh, begrudging?
No, that's begrudgingly?

00:01:55.314 --> 00:01:57.249
No, no.
Uh...

00:01:57.249 --> 00:01:59.451
Um, running, running, running.
-Running, very good.

00:01:59.451 --> 00:02:00.486
Running.
-I had to go basic.

00:02:00.486 --> 00:02:01.687
