00:02:01.687 --> 00:02:04.891
-Advice that you would give
a shy teenager?

00:02:04.891 --> 00:02:06.425
-Stay golden, Pony Boy.

00:02:06.425 --> 00:02:09.595
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:09.595 --> 00:02:12.031
-These are
the best answers ever.

00:02:12.031 --> 00:02:13.632
Stay golden, Pony Boy.
Oh my gosh.

00:02:13.632 --> 00:02:15.534
-It's a safe one.
-Another good reference.

00:02:15.534 --> 00:02:19.104
Oh, my gosh.
[ Laughing ]

00:02:19.104 --> 00:02:20.573
Body part.

00:02:20.573 --> 00:02:21.975
-Perineum.

00:02:21.975 --> 00:02:26.011
[ Laughter ]

00:02:26.011 --> 00:02:27.580
-I'm gonna have
to give my cue-card guy

00:02:27.580 --> 00:02:30.883
mouth-to-mouth after perineum.

00:02:30.883 --> 00:02:32.251
-Well, I can't --
I mean, that's --

00:02:32.251 --> 00:02:34.721
You want to go medical on that.
-No, no, perineum.

00:02:34.721 --> 00:02:35.954
Is that something?

00:02:35.954 --> 00:02:38.625
-Oh, it's the space between --
-Okay, got you.

00:02:38.625 --> 00:02:42.027
[ Laughter ]

00:02:42.027 --> 00:02:43.595
That's not
what that song is about.

00:02:43.595 --> 00:02:44.864
That's not
what that song is about.

00:02:44.864 --> 00:02:46.865
-That is for me.
-No, it is not.

00:02:46.865 --> 00:02:48.601
-That's how
Dave Matthews speaks to me!

00:02:48.601 --> 00:02:50.937
-That's not what it's about.
That's not what it's about.

00:02:50.937 --> 00:02:52.772
Oh, my gosh.
-Here we are.

00:02:52.772 --> 00:02:54.740
-No, I know.
This is great.

00:02:54.740 --> 00:02:56.042
Object.

00:02:56.042 --> 00:02:57.343
-Protractor.

00:02:57.343 --> 00:03:02.648
[ Laughter ]

00:03:02.648 --> 00:03:04.650
-A plural noun.

00:03:04.650 --> 00:03:06.185
-Puppies.
-Aww.

00:03:06.185 --> 00:03:08.554
-Puppies.
-Aww.

00:03:08.554 --> 00:03:11.090
