00:03:19.398 --> 00:03:21.934
-"Teacher, my name's not Dave!"

00:03:21.934 --> 00:03:23.803
[ Laughter ]

00:03:23.803 --> 00:03:26.172
-Oh, my gosh.

00:03:26.172 --> 00:03:27.273
-'Cause I wouldn't --
I would never...

